# The instrument panel itself is built by MTEReactorCoreMk1's shared formatters, so the GUI,
# both control blocks and the scanner print byte-identical lines; only the standalone labels
# below still live here.
# NEI tab names. These keys ARE the recipe maps' unlocalized names (GT translates them for the
# tab title and the page header), so they must match BTSDisplayRecipes exactly.
